{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-5565cb390db1b9d2934e4f8675d52032519804ee3b02d7fc","family_id":"KR:012159","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society","title_original":"4ㆍ16세월호참사 진상규명 및 안전사회 건설 등을 위한 특별법","kind":"법률","source_version":"284117","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=284117","source_sha256":"c141291f23520264444e31f7c7002ae169ff7b5f49b50f81aade863d8c364da6","body_sha256":"bc1fc7fa65a829819f5dbc5738be4fda866594b4daa28f55101bd2b0c9c3e73a","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 53 (Administrative Fines) (1) Any of the following persons shall be subject to an administrative fine not exceeding 30 million won:\n  1. Any person who fails to comply with a request to submit materials or things required under Article 26 (1) 3 without just grounds, or who submits false materials or things; \n  2. Any person who fails to comply with a request to present materials or things under Article 26 (2) without just grounds, or who presents false materials or things.\n  (2) Any of the following persons shall be subject to an administrative fine not exceeding ten million won:\n  1. Any person who makes a false reply to an inquiry into facts under Article 26 (1) 4; \n  2. Any person who refuses or interferes with an on-site investigation prescribed in Article 26 (1) 6 without just grounds;\n  3. Any person who fails to comply with an order to accompany prescribed in Article 27 without just grounds; \n  4. Any person who accords unfavorable treatment, in violation of Article 43 (2).\n  (3) Administrative fines referred to in paragraphs (1) and (2) shall be imposed and collected by the Chairperson of the Inquest, as prescribed by Presidential Decree.  \n  (4) The Act on the Regulation of Violations of Public Order shall apply to matters related to procedures for the imposition, collection, trials, execution, etc., of administrative fines referred to in paragraphs (1) and (2). For the purposes of administrative fines, the Chairperson of the Inquest shall be deemed an administrative agency defined in subparagraph 2 of Article 2 of the Act on the Regulation of Violations of Public Order.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.title.json","sha256":"4c74ab84248a6134281cf6996ae8261b572ae5b9e5754e6ad1e8c39880d0d84f"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-53.json","sha256":"8f5354cd98ebf7a3d7ba34535bdc6df0dc12dc6e98f5c8e54fe75b9380e7eb4f"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-53.selfcheck.json","sha256":"fb1a218d73ef54b54c3e9c45291c8735436dacabe55f8d1f4b440f1298e32305"},"text":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-53.txt","sha256":"15f0660f3580e47cd026a770d3c14a2e7edec3f6bfc08210b18631f88b740153"},"unit_key":"article-53"}],"body_and_addenda_complete":false,"component_id":"PARENT:kr-012159-284117-ko","component_ids":["PARENT:kr-012159-284117-ko:article-53"],"component_kind":"PARENT","edition_id":"edition-aaac9e18dc1283df53dd49fe3d7839553ade3b573357548d","frozen_scope_plan_record":{"path":